WEBVTT

00:00:00.-026 --> 00:00:04.670
Every year in Spain about 200 people die in fires,

00:00:04.666 --> 00:00:08.360
most of them in homes.

00:00:08.372 --> 00:00:14.000
Many of these deaths could have been 
prevented by a smoke alarm.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.880
That is why the Professional Association 
of Firefighter Technicians

00:00:17.875 --> 00:00:22.265
supports the Europe smoke Alarm Day campaign.

00:00:22.273 --> 00:00:24.773
These devices, which can be easily 
purchased in commercial establishments,

00:00:24.779 --> 00:00:30.430
These devices, which can be easily purchased 
in commercial establishments,

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:35.583
are very easy to install and also inexpensive. 

00:00:35.556 --> 00:00:38.056
Installing a smoke alarm in our homes

00:00:38.065 --> 00:00:41.573
can really save our lives. 

00:00:41.569 --> 00:00:48.553
That is why we insist and encourage people to use 
these devices, installing them in their home.

00:00:48.543 --> 00:00:51.155
I am Victor Manuel Fernandez,

00:00:51.156 --> 00:00:55.475
Vice President of the Professional Association
of Firefighter Technicians

00:00:55.479 --> 00:01:00.135
chief of the Fuenlabrada Fire Department, in Madrid, Spain

00:01:00.149 --> 00:01:02.649
Thank you very much.